rrorInSubSteps":false},{"stepId":"e2aebca2a1a91beedbd9573a27ce401b","name":"s20-nh-spaces.md (/snf): Pass","status":"passed","steps":[{"link":{"id":"f74d60a6e95878f8c01fa77e7b376167","originalFileName":"d5e28415-4840-4ca8-8d92-e2b7cc4610f4-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":2213},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"b3c5b1c461d6b6fc3dbb959b298bd89f","originalFileName":"fd87bdc8-b1ee-497c-95c4-5579626bcc7c-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":66967},"type":"attachment"}],"parameters":[],"start":1791929721231,"stop":1791929721231,"duration":0,"type":"step","hasSimilarErrorInSubSteps":false},{"link":{"id":"b88c956f2b6c9e18f186b07630a8201d","originalFileName":"6f9e3819-4b3b-4ae5-b3df-f121ada0628e-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"agent's notes (facts it saw, not a verdict)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":2250},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"0bcfd426aa42371fc1a4b5f48aabdb93","originalFileName":"b18d9a78-1099-4a6f-9749-27e1507ef0fc-attachment.json","ext":".json","name":"oracle verdict","contentType":"application/json","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":4486},"type":"attachment"}],"error":{"message":"Checked by Quinn's runner (ledger.md #23): Fail (S07 only, product — cluster C1) — S07: NH search for 'hip fracture' matches the resident by diagnosis (should say No residents match); search hint offers 'diagnosis'. S17 (search across mode switches), S20 (retype/clear/spaces) pass"},"testCase":{"id":"cabc78dd0e88f811788f3d26fc706267","externalId":"41b0c715ede4ee806e611765b2f43a41","name":"[dev] S20 Fast re-type and a whitespace-only query, both contexts","fullName":"TC-03 Search & Sort › TC-03/S20"},"descriptionHtml":"<div class=\"rc-approach\"><p><b>思路 / Approach</b> · TC-03 Search &amp; Sort · <b>S20</b> 「快速重新输入和只有空格的查询，两个模式」 <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\" lang=\"en\">Fast re-type and a whitespace-only query, both contexts</span></p><p><b>覆盖的 UAT 步骤 / 票 AC：</b></p><ul><li><b>U1</b> Hospital: search by name, by room, by MRN and by diagnosis each returns the correct matching patients, each field on its own.（UAT TC-03；TFA-92581 AC 2；TFA-92581 AC 5）</li><li><b>U4</b> Nursing Home: search by name, by unit/room, by MRN and by facility each returns the correct matching residents, each field on its own.（UAT TC-03；TFA-92581 AC 3；TFA-92581 AC 6）</li></ul><p><b>测试设计方法：</b>错误推测（error-guessing） — 专门去撞最容易出错的地方（失败、重复点、两个标签页、时钟不对、注入的指令）。</p><p><b>Given </b>Standard fixture</p><p><b>When </b>Hospital: type 'pneumonia' and, without waiting, replace it with 'zz-no-match-zz'; clear it; type three spaces. Nursing Home Today's Visits: type 'QA Resident' and, without waiting, replace it with 'zz-no-match-zz'; clear it; type three spaces</p><p><b>Then </b>After the second query the record is not listed and the no-match message shows (no stale results from the first query). After Clear it is back. Spaces alone show the full list, not a no-match message. Same in both contexts</p><p><b>通过的标准（oracle，节选）：</b>oracle.mjs: cp1 mustContain 'No patients match', mustNotContain {hospitalPatient}; cp2 mustContain {hospitalPatient}; cp3 mustContain {hospitalPatient}, mustNotContain 'No patients match'; cp4 mustContain 'No residents match', mustNotContain {snfResident}; cp5 mustContain {snfResident}; cp6 mustContain {snfResident}, mustNotContain 'No residents match' (U1, U4)</p><p><b>在哪跑：</b>dev 单元 U23；测试方法 AGENT · 浏览器 agent；矩阵里排的车道 浏览器 agent（automated）</p><p><small>S20 是我们自己编的用例号（覆盖矩阵 cases/TC-03.matrix.json 里的编号），不是 UAT 文档里的步骤号。</small></p></div><p><b>环境：dev</b> — dev 部署，build <code>e02167f</code>（Deploy Convex，2026-10-12T18:24:27Z）；账号和地址不写进报告；run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>。</p><p><b>测试方法：</b>AGENT · 浏览器 agent — 按 cases/test-methods.json 的分类，分类说在 both 跑；来源：<code>dev</code>。</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-03 Search &amp; Sort · <b>Section:</b> A1 · Home Screen &amp; Dashboard · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-03/S20</p><p><b>Fast re-type and a whitespace-only query, both contexts</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92581 Search &amp; Sort (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>units/U23.verdict.json</code>), unit U23 split by its parts' checkpoints. Agent: 88 turns, 263 s, $0.60.</p><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U23 (#23, ready-for-qa, ui-only) — Search box, both contexts. Same legacy seed, same search box, read-only typing (diagnosis words, names / MRN across contexts, fast re-type and whitespace). No part opens a chart or changes a row. Runs together with TC-03/S07, TC-03/S17.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #23, U23; checked: yes): <b>Fail (S07 only, product — cluster C1)</b> — S07: NH search for 'hip fracture' matches the resident by diagnosis (should say No residents match); search hint offers 'diagnosis'. S17 (search across mode switches), S20 (retype/clear/spaces) pass</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-03 Search & Sort","S20 Fast re-type and a whitespace-only query, both contexts"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"f8611732734355924b5f993b70afddf3","originalFileName":"1aef3d60-ddfd-4cce-93fe-471c907461d6-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":1982,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"de8e5669ea5e0d111bb9a44d0fb2396d","originalFileName":"59bd9acf-f4fc-4a3d-8483-10c2b80a964f-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":66707},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"bb42cb46ce123bae4ec26c217037e789","originalFileName":"4f9d193c-bd34-4044-9b98-f4de42b21055-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tr